{"server":"cn","storyId":"act13d0_level_act13d0_st06","groupId":"act13d0","stageId":null,"title":"交错光影","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act13d0/level_act13d0_st06.txt","sourceHash":"1570f11b2e9ad1ff8bead19277086cf04f6603fcffc044a64525d6d51e1b49fe","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在Ms.Christine的带领下，人事干员找到傀影并向其询问档案相关的问题。傀影的回答并非谎言，却让在场的人感到困惑。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"交错光影"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"女士们，先生们，欢迎各位今夜到来，下面让我们观赏本剧团的最新剧目！\n这盛大的剧目您绝不会在其他地方见到，独占、专属，正是只存在于此的至福享受！\n请洗净您的双眼，磨尖您的听觉，享受这个美妙的夜晚......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"欢迎各位来到猩红剧团——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac13_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（轻声唱歌）"},{"type":"narration","text":"Answer.\nThe shadow in the dark."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是谁。谁在黑夜中唤我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"时候到了，我该准备登台。"},{"type":"narration","text":"Answer.\nThe shadow in the dark.\nThe killer on the stage."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谁在说话。谁在唱歌。"},{"type":"narration","text":"Answer.\nYour darkness is asking."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"帷幕拉开，灯光垂落，演员站在中央。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么声音，是谁在期待，是谁在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——喝彩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"But\nIn the fact who you are.\nWho you are.\nThe shadow in the dark."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_stage"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac13_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是黑夜中的幽灵，幕布后的幻影，舞台上的明星。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"我是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac13_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演员A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你是谁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们都知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演员C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你藏在破屋里，你躲在长桌后，你把自己塞在那些恶魔的言语和漆黑字符下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你和我们一起唱歌，我们时常练习，你唱得最好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"你们是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"你们不是这出戏的演员，那么又为什么会出现在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......认得我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演员A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你问我们是谁，你竟已经不认得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演员A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么能够忘记？怎么胆敢忘记？魔鬼选中你，教你音乐，教你念词，教你领略这舞台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演员A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你着了魔，追随魔鬼的指引，可在最后却又背弃。你杀了魔鬼，离开这里，现在已将我们都忘记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演员A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你真认为自己能杀掉魔鬼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是这样，我没有忘记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经将所有人都杀死。那些人的做法是错误的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"沉溺是错误的，追随是错误的，觉得美是错误的，我必须要杀掉他们，我必须这样做——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你杀死了他们，同时也夺走我们的呼吸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演员C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就在这舞台上，你开始唱歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"你们早已经被我杀死，为什么还会出现在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"久违了，我们亲爱的兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们一起背井离乡，我们一起长大。我们是流淌着不同血的亲人，同吃同住，却走向不同的结局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我已经很久没同你说过话，自从蜡烛融化，我的血液同烛泪一起滴在舞台上，自那之后，我们就再没有说过话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演员C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"与你不同，无缘领略艺术真谛的演员，不过是筛选后的失败品，空有喜爱，却无才华。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演员C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而有人扑火，有人选择逃离。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也有人仍停留在过去，在那个夜里。歌声响起，歌声一直未停息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......时间到了。属于过去的幻影不会在这里停留太久，我们不该在这舞台上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！别走——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"咳——咳、呃，咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"我的......喉咙......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演员A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"多可悲，午夜的幽灵，分不清自己。失去歌喉，你还剩下什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演员A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"逃离这里，又真的能逃离今夜吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演员A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不该出声。你不该唱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演员A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不该在这舞台上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Answer.\nThe shadow in the dark.\nAnswer.\nWho you are.\nAnd what you really desire."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"女士们，先生们，帷幕已落下......\n希望各位能够有一个美好的夜晚......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我、想要......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"08:10 A.M.  天气/阴雨\n罗德岛舰船，第二舱室，人事后勤部门"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"这一批的干员应该都在这里了，1、2、3......好，没问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？这个是......这个编号怎么是上一批的，是谁整理的时候这么不小心，居然编号都能弄混。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"傀影？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"谁啊，我怎么不记得还有这个干员。嗯？这档案怎么还缺了一部分？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"怪了，这是什么情况啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"已经习惯舰内的生活了吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"是的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然也还有一些不是很明白的地方，但是天火学姐一直很照顾我，没问题的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，对了，博士，天火学姐给我的干员手册，我已经全部读完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"里面记了好多注意事项，每一条都写得很清楚，读起来又有意思，这个到底是谁写的呀，作者真的很厉害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，食堂的饭菜很好吃，天火学姐说我都胖了一圈了，强行塞给了我一张芙蓉小姐的健康餐宣传单，但学姐自己明明吃得也不少嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，还有啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，对不起，博士，我是不是说得太多了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不会。看来你已经很适应了，我很高兴。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"欸嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的大家都很和善，也很照顾我，真的很开心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想赶快变得可靠起来，如果能帮上大家的忙就最好不过了。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，对不起，果然是我的话太多惹人烦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"呜，今后我会注意的......"}]},{"label":"没关系。其实你学姐也胖了。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"对吧！我也觉得！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，可不能让学姐听到哦，天火学姐生气起来，真的会把博士的办公室烧掉的......"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，有人来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"请进。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"打扰了，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"这里有一份档案需要确认，您现在有时间吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生和阿米娅说，关于这件事可以来这里找您处理。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"让我看看吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（将档案资料递给博士）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"就是这一份档案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"这位干员傀影相关背景的记录并不完整，有不少信息都缺失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道之前的负责人是哪一位......人事部门的工作记录表上并没有署名，大概是工作疏漏吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"最近正好因为多了不少新人，我们那里在着手整理目前在籍的所有干员的资料，像这样的遗漏其实还有不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然也不是什么大问题，但是还是得要逐一补齐才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来好像很辛苦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有需要的话，我也可以帮忙哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"你是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，我是术师小组的新成员，代号薄绿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我记得你，是之前任务途中和大家走散了的那个新人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，天火小姐发了很大脾气呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"呜，非常抱歉，给大家添麻烦了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"学姐一定也很生我的气，之后狠狠骂了我一通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？不是哦，并不是生你的气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"天火小姐是因为自己没有注意到后辈的状态，而在生自己的气......至少她当时是这么说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？学姐她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"天火小姐对他人有时会有点严格，是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"但实际上她对自己会更加严格，就像上次的事一样，比起埋怨别人，她第一时间就会先反思自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"明明那也不能怪她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"所以说，见过她对自己的要求标准，就会产生一种确实是自己太不像样了的感觉，偶尔被说两句，好像也没什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"没错！学姐确实是这样的人，在这一点上，我相当敬佩学姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，看出来了。总之，谢谢你愿意来帮忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"最近我们确实吸收了许多新鲜血液，不管是我们这里还是医疗部门和后勤部门，大家都有点忙不过来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，对了，说回干员傀影的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"之前提到了，其实有不少干员的档案都存在一些需要补足的地方，一般来说，小问题的话我们都是直接找到本人，问清楚就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，这位干员傀影的情况有一些特殊......坦白说，我们轻易根本找不到他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"这位先生是目前不在舰内吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"不，根据任务记录来看，对方现在并没有外勤任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"干员傀影本人似乎一直在有意避开和其他干员碰面，再加上他的源石技艺，想要找到他不怎么容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然也可以在一些地方蹲守，或者去找可露希尔小姐帮忙......但是目前人手不足，总是等着不是办法，而后者嘛，嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"听说之前对方加入的时候闹出了点岔子，已经惹到可露希尔小姐了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"最好还是不要让可露希尔小姐有机会公报私仇吧？会发生什么真的很难想象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来好难......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"这位傀影先生的源石技艺，是像伊桑先生一样吗？还有......呃我看看手册，对了，还有狮蝎小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"狮蝎小姐也有隐藏行踪的能力吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，我记得狮蝎小姐刚加入的时候，大家也是费了不少功夫，才终于做完了记录。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟很可能只要稍微一眨眼，就再也注意不到狮蝎小姐了，真的很难以处理。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"狮蝎本人也很苦恼。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"确实是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"当时我们只能在纸条上和狮蝎小姐通过书写来交流，真的费了不少功夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，至少在主观意愿上，狮蝎小姐还是非常愿意配合我们的。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"看这个反应......博士也还记得吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"上回博士差点就忘记狮蝎小姐还在房间里，直接把门给锁上了。"}]},{"label":"可能她现在就在这间房间里。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？！狮蝎小姐在这里吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"真的吗，博士？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"应该是开玩笑的吧？真是的，博士，别随便乱开这种玩笑啊......"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"比起狮蝎小姐的无可奈何，干员傀影的话，感觉就只是单纯的在用自己的源石技艺，避开所有人而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"这样啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"关于这件事，凯尔希医生和阿米娅都说可以来找博士帮忙，博士，你有什么好主意吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不是完全没办法。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？太好了，要怎么才能找到对方？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这种时候，一般我们需要征求女士的意见。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"女士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你是指......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"又是那个梦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"那天晚上的舞台，还有那些人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"（......不，不对。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"（那一天，那个晚上没有发生这种事，一切都很顺利。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"（他们不会再出现。他们不该再出现。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"（......亡灵，已经被我杀死。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"流淌不止的河流在我耳边唱出乐声，向我冲刷，离我远去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"或许从未有人真正离去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯？有脚步声，这个声音是......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ms.Christine","speakerId":"avg_npc_130","isRemote":false,"text":"喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"是你啊，Ms.Christine。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ms.Christine","speakerId":"avg_npc_130","isRemote":false,"text":"喵~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起来心情不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ms.Christine","speakerId":"avg_npc_130","isRemote":false,"text":"喵，喵嗷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"我没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"不用担心，已经习惯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"那些幻影，那些视线一直都在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ms.Christine","speakerId":"avg_npc_130","isRemote":false,"text":"咪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，我知道还有其他客人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"——博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"早上好。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"阴雨天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"这个早晨恐怕不太美妙。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......"}]},{"label":"又是听脚步声就能知道是谁？","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"人们踏出的每一步，沉重或轻快，急促或舒缓，都会透露出许多讯息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"想要区分并不困难。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"除了你，还有其他人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"有两个陌生的脚步声，一个轻些，另一个笨重。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，被发现了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"真厉害，我还特地走得很小心呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"确实是敏锐到可怕的听觉......哎，笨重的那个是说我吗？我最近确实是胖了点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我觉得这不是在说体重的问题啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"说吧，来找我有什么事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"Ms.Christine很少带客人来，看来你确实很受青睐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我很荣幸。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ms.Christine","speakerId":"avg_npc_130","isRemote":false,"text":"喵，喵呜~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，Ms.Christine在表达赞同。"}]},{"label":"你刚刚躲在哪里？","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有躲藏，只是眼睛在欺骗你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"眼、耳、喉、鼻，所有的感官都会骗人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......甚至连回忆也会。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎么说，总算是见到面了。您好，干员傀影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"你是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我是人事部的工作人员，您留存在人事部的档案有一部分没有完整录入，这次打扰是有一些问题想要重新确认一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"档案？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了。罗德岛想知道些什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢您的配合。不用担心，只需要您回答一些简单的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，在此之前，请先容我确认一下您的源石技艺控制状态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"为傀影先生特制的监控设备目前在使用上有出现什么问题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"特别是平常使用的时候......比如说现在这样对话，源石技艺会有任何脱离控制的倾向吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"根据傀影先生的反馈，如果有需要，技术部门后续将会为您调整设备的相应功能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"不必，现在这样就足够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"一定程度上对结晶的抑制，以及针对波长和幅度的调整，这些功能都非常有用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"只要不将音节连成旋律，就没有问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......多谢你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"不用客气，辅助干员们控制自己的源石技艺，也是我们该做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么问题那就太好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"那么接下来......是关于傀影先生的出生地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"上一次录入资料时，据您所说，您的出生地是在维多利亚西北部的克莱布拉松地区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"克莱布拉松......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......这就奇怪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"根据您提供的信息，我们在维多利亚的办事处派人前往当地进行了核实，但是从结果来看，现实情况似乎和傀影先生所说的有一些出入。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，是不是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_stage"},{"type":"narration","text":"舞台落幕了。\n那些布料上渗出了血。\n鲜花被踩烂在地上。\n怎么回事？\n有什么东西发出碎裂声，是晚餐时的玻璃杯。\n柜门开始掉漆。街边的人在笑。\n番茄落在地上，花被人踩过。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"风把钢琴吹响。\n闷热，舞台上的灯光刺破黑色的布。\n观众在路边鼓掌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"——巷子里的人是谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"怎么回事？\n怎么回事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"——在笑的人，是谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"克莱布拉松。是不是根本就不存在？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的调查人员没有找到类似名称的移动城市，或者区域......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"傀影先生，我必须要提醒您，如果您不想公开自己的出身地，可以有其他选择，申请暂时保密或是设置相应查看权限都没有问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，如果在这份基础资料上说了谎，那么事情的性质就完全不同了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我们可以容许干员对一些信息进行隐藏、保密，直接拒绝回答都行，但是谎言......这对我们双方建立信赖关系没有任何好处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"您能明白吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......不是谎言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"录入时我说的是实话，并没有欺骗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"曾经收留我的人告诉过我，我出生在那里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"那个人说，我们的村庄被天灾摧毁，田地被战火卷席，四处流浪的剧团恰巧在这时路过，失去家园的孩子们得以被剧团收留。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"之后，我们跟随剧团离开......再也没有回去过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"除了这个名字外，我对那片土地一无所知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"真的很奇怪，这到底是怎么一回事......会不会是您的长辈弄错了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，有没有可能是傀影先生记错？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"或许是弄错了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"这件事可以之后再验证。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，也只能先这样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，只要不是故意欺骗，这些基础信息可以先做特殊处理，之后再补充或修改也没关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，可以这样吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为不管在哪里，这种档案都会做得相当严格呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"维多利亚的大学在这方面就相当严厉，如果在档案出现问题，严重的甚至可能会被退学！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"一般来说，确实是会比较严格的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"但是罗德岛的人员构成比较特殊，事情也不能做得那么绝对......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"例如小蛇屠箱那样的例子，她自己确实什么都不记得了，我们也没有办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"还有一些有特殊情况的干员，在判断对方对罗德岛没有危害之后，还是会适当通融的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？啊，不用，不用客气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚说的情况属实的话，这事也不能算是傀影先生的错......总之，我们之后会再尝试去查找一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"如果仍然没有结果，这件事我会如实上报，交由上面来判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"也不用太担心，阿米娅在这方面一向不太计较的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，让我看看还有什么......啊，对了，请问傀影先生加入罗德岛的动机是什么？这个姑且也是需要询问一下的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"您是感染者，那果然还是为了矿石病的治疗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"我在找一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"找人？是我们的干员吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不能确定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"我在找一个人。有一件事，我要查清楚，所以我必须要找到那个知情的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"那些来自过去的鬼魂，就站在街角，在窗外，在我身边......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"那些东西，我必须摆脱它们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"只有找到那些真正的过去，才能彻底解决它。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"这是在说什么呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，您怎么确定要找的人就在罗德岛呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"我听到音乐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"我听到声音，那声音让我到这儿来，这里有我想要的线索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"答案就在这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（博士，博士！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（这位傀影干员真的没问题？看起来很不妙啊，真的不需要去医疗部门再检查一下？？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"（矿石病确实有影响听觉，甚至神经和思维的病例，傀影先生难道也是吗......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我认为他的情况不完全是矿石病的影响。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"你在说什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"没什么","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"对了，从刚刚起就有一个问题想问。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你挂在衣柜门上的那件衣服，很显眼，是过去的戏服吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说什么？衣柜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"我并没有——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"这件衣服，是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么......什么时候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"它不该出现在这里——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_stage"},{"type":"narration","text":"塞在柜子里的花束。\n绿色的阴云。\n长出眼睛的水泥柱，融化的树叶。两边全是坐席。\n掌声雷动。街边的行人喝彩。\n垃圾罐站起来跳舞，谁在唱歌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"谁在唱歌。\n——谁在唱歌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那些衣服上渗出红色，花被踩碎在地上。\n坐席上没有人。\n街边没有人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"（克莱布拉松，克莱布拉松，好奇怪，总觉得好像在什么地方听过这个地名......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯......是在哪儿来着。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"哎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"完全想不起来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"算啦，之后去借点书来查查看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，抱歉，是不是吓到你了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是......新来的干员吧，是遇到了什么麻烦吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"对、对不起，不是您的问题，是我反应过度了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是有一点想不明白的问题，稍微发了会呆......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？有什么我可以帮你的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请不要客气，就当做是吓到你的赔礼吧。如果愿意，可以和我说说你的烦恼，如果有什么我可以帮得上忙的，就再好不过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢......您真是个好人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛果然大家都很亲切......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，多谢夸奖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你之前在说，想不起来的是什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"原来您听到了呀。我是在想一个地名......克莱布拉松。我总觉得像是听过，但就是想不起是在哪里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"您有听说过这个地方吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......真令人熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没有想到，还能听到这个名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，您知道这个地方吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当然。我当然知道这个地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很久之前，我曾经生活在那片土地上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我从他人的口中听说了它的名字，属于现在的人是不会提起的这个名字的，只有早该被埋葬在过去的枯朽残骸还会记得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那个人和他口中的一切，分明都已经腐烂在过去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄绿","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，有些偏题了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你有时间听故事吗？如果有时间，我可以给你说一个故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"关于克莱布拉松，关于那里的人，关于一些亲人失去庇护的孩子，以及路过小村庄的流浪剧团......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我可以全都说给你听。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"让我们换一个安静些的地方吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......那会是一个很长的故事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["人事干员"]},{"speakerId":"char_250_phantom","aliases":["傀影"]},{"speakerId":"char_388_mint","aliases":["薄绿"]}]}
